### SBOM AI API Test Collection
### This file contains all API endpoints for testing

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.id}}

### 1. Health Checks

### Check Application Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Content-Type: application/json

### Check Parser Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/parser
Content-Type: application/json

### Check System Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/system
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Project Management

### List All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?page=0&size=10&sortBy=name&sortOrder=asc
Content-Type: application/json

### List Projects with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?search=java&status=active&team=Backend%20Team&page=0&size=5
Content-Type: application/json

### Create New Project
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test-project-api",
  "description": "A test project for API validation",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "classifier": "Application",
  "tags": ["test", "api", "spring"],
  "team": "Test Team",
  "language": "Java",
  "repository": {
    "url": "https://github.com/test/test-project",
    "type": "github",
    "branch": "main"
  }
}

### Get Project Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Project
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description for test project",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "tags": ["test", "api", "spring", "updated"],
  "active": true
}

### 3. SBOM Upload

### Upload SBOM File
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/upload-sbom
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-sbom.json"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bomFormat": "CycloneDX",
  "specVersion": "1.4",
  "metadata": {
    "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
    "tools": [
      {
        "vendor": "SBOM AI",
        "name": "sbomai-parser-go",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      }
    ]
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "library",
      "name": "spring-boot-starter-web",
      "version": "3.1.0",
      "purl": "pkg:maven/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-starter-web@3.1.0"
    }
  ]
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Project Scans

### Get Project Scans
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/scans?page=0&size=10&status=completed
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Project Vulnerabilities

### Get Project Vulnerabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/vulnerabilities?page=0&size=10&severity=high
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Project Dependencies

### Get Project Dependencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/dependencies?page=0&size=10&type=library
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Bulk Operations

### Bulk Delete Projects
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/bulk-delete
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "uuid1",
  "uuid2",
  "uuid3"
]

### Bulk Update Projects
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/bulk-update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectIds": ["uuid1", "uuid2"],
  "updates": {
    "status": "ARCHIVED",
    "active": false,
    "team": "Archived Team"
  }
}

### 8. Statistics

### Get Project Statistics Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/stats/summary
Content-Type: application/json

### Get High Risk Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/stats/high-risk?minRiskScore=70
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Error Testing

### Test Invalid Project ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/invalid-uuid
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Duplicate Project Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test-project-api",
  "description": "Duplicate project name test",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "classifier": "Application"
}

### Test Invalid SBOM Upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/upload-sbom
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a valid SBOM file
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 10. Cleanup

### Delete Test Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json 